:project       papercode - 可验证论文研究自动化系统
:author        S0ra-ai
:repo
:desc          0.7.x 历史变更归档，主 CHANGELOG 仅保留当前活跃版本线
:version       0.7.0-dev
:last_update   2026/05/11

:history

    0.7.0-dev - 2026/05/11 (1db0157) [develop]
        :brief Agent Team capability acceptance and no-mock boundary
        :changes
        - test(acceptance): 新增 Agent Team capability acceptance 场景, 覆盖内置 skills/MCP/Python capability fusion、harness approval、递归 team 和 source-bound evidence merge
        - test(strict): strict acceptance 增加 agent-team-capability-fusion、paper-workbench-ux-sidebar、hf-no-mock-boundary、changelog-split-archives 检查
        - test(hf): 最终验收锁定产品默认 no-mock 边界, 未授权 HF 网络不会生成伪数据
        - test(ux): 验收 PaperRun 右侧栏保留 cost/token/context/outline 并叠加 Agent Team、Gate、Memory/Code 诊断
        - test(changelog): 验收 TaskFlow changelog split preferences 与 docs/changelog/v0/0.1.x.CHANGELOG
        :src
            - scripts/strict-acceptance.ps1 - strict acceptance checks for Agent Team, capability bus, PaperRun UX sidebar, HF no-mock boundary, changelog split archives
            - reports/strict-live-acceptance.md - updated fixture-mode strict acceptance report
        :test
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/agent-team-capability-acceptance.test.ts - mixed topic/code/web/HF Agent Team acceptance
            - packages/opencode/test/paper/strict-acceptance.test.ts - strict acceptance inventory regression
        :verification
            - powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\strict-acceptance.ps1 -FixtureMode -CheckTimeoutSeconds 120 -ReportPath reports/strict-live-acceptance.md
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 --cwd packages/opencode test test/paper/agent-team-capability-acceptance.test.ts test/paper/strict-acceptance.test.ts
            - npx --yes bun@1.3.13 run --cwd packages/opencode typecheck
            - TaskFlow validate_task agent-team-capability-acceptance
            - TaskFlow validate_changelog_format
            - git diff --check
